                    "Daily learning & feedback": {"extractionState":"manual","comment":"Android Minik daily_learning.xml: daily_learning_title","localizations":{"am":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ዕለታዊ ትምህርት እና አስተያየት"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"التعلّم اليومي والملاحظات"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tägliches Lernen und Feedback"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Daily learning & feedback"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprendizaje diario y comentarios"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Apprentissage quotidien et avis"}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"למידה יומית ומשוב"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dagelijks leren en feedback"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprendizado diário e comentários"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprendizagem diária e comentários"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ежедневное обучение и отзывы"}}}},
                    "Today: %lld of 5 little wins": {"extractionState":"manual","comment":"Android Minik daily_learning.xml: daily_learning_progress","localizations":{"am":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ዛሬ፦ ከ5 ትናንሽ ስኬቶች %lld"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"اليوم: %lld من 5 نجاحات صغيرة"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Heute: %lld von 5 kleinen Erfolgen"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Today: %lld of 5 little wins"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hoy: %lld de 5 pequeños logros"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aujourd’hui : %lld petites réussites sur 5"}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"היום: %lld מתוך 5 הצלחות קטנות"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vandaag: %lld van 5 kleine successen"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hoje: %lld de 5 pequenas conquistas"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hoje: %lld de 5 pequenas conquistas"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Сегодня: %lld из 5 маленьких успехов"}}}},
                    "Choose any learning game. Each play that earns points adds one little win. Progress is saved for this child and learning language. No rush, and no penalty for a day off.": {"extractionState":"manual","comment":"Android Minik daily_learning.xml: daily_learning_body","localizations":{"am":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ማንኛውንም የመማሪያ ጨዋታ ይምረጡ። ነጥብ የሚያስገኝ እያንዳንዱ ስኬት ይቆጠራል። እድገቱ ለልጁ እና ለሚማረው ቋንቋ ይቀመጣል። ቀስ ብለው ይማሩ፤ አንድ ቀን ማረፍ ቅጣት የለውም።"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"اختر أي لعبة تعليمية. كل نجاح يمنح نقاطًا يُحتسب. يُحفظ التقدّم لكل طفل ولغة تعلّم. لا داعي للاستعجال ولا عقوبة على يوم راحة."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wählt ein Lernspiel. Jeder Erfolg mit Punkten zählt. Der Fortschritt wird für dieses Kind und die Lernsprache gespeichert. Kein Zeitdruck und kein Verlust durch einen freien Tag."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose any learning game. Each play that earns points adds one little win. Progress is saved for this child and learning language. No rush, and no penalty for a day off."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Elige un juego educativo. Cada acierto que da puntos cuenta. El progreso se guarda para este niño y su idioma de aprendizaje. Sin prisas ni penalización por descansar."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choisissez un jeu éducatif. Chaque réussite qui rapporte des points compte. La progression est enregistrée pour cet enfant et cette langue. Prenez votre temps ; une pause ne retire rien."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"בוחרים כל משחק לימוד שרוצים. כל הצלחה שמזכה בנקודות מוסיפה הצלחה קטנה. ההתקדמות נשמרת לילד ולשפת הלימוד. אין לחץ, ואפשר גם לקחת יום חופש."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kies een leerspel. Elk succes dat punten oplevert telt. De voortgang wordt per kind en leertaal bewaard. Geen haast en geen straf voor een dagje rust."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escolha um jogo educativo. Cada acerto que rende pontos conta. O progresso é salvo para esta criança e o idioma aprendido. Sem pressa nem penalidade por tirar um dia de folga."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escolha um jogo educativo. Cada acerto que rende pontos conta. O progresso é salvo para esta criança e o idioma aprendido. Sem pressa nem penalidade por tirar um dia de folga."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Выберите обучающую игру. Каждый успех, приносящий очки, засчитывается. Прогресс сохраняется для ребёнка и изучаемого языка. Без спешки и штрафов за день отдыха."}}}},
                    "Five little wins today. Well done!": {"extractionState":"manual","comment":"Android Minik daily_learning.xml: daily_learning_done","localizations":{"am":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ዛሬ አምስት ትናንሽ ስኬቶች። ጎበዝ!"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"خمسة نجاحات صغيرة اليوم. أحسنت!"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fünf kleine Erfolge heute. Gut gemacht!"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Five little wins today. Well done!"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cinco pequeños logros hoy. ¡Muy bien!"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cinq petites réussites aujourd’hui. Bravo !"}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"חמש הצלחות קטנות היום. כל הכבוד!"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vijf kleine successen vandaag. Goed gedaan!"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cinco pequenas conquistas hoje. Parabéns!"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cinco pequenas conquistas hoje. Parabéns!"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Пять маленьких успехов сегодня. Молодец!"}}}},
