                    "Daily math journey": {"extractionState":"manual","comment":"Android Minik Math Plus journey.xml: daily_title (English and Hebrew; other languages authored for iOS)","localizations":{"am":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ዕለታዊ የሂሳብ ጉዞ"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"رحلة الرياضيات اليومية"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tägliche Mathe-Reise"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Daily math journey"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Viaje matemático diario"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Voyage mathématique du jour"}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"מסע החשבון היומי"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dagelijkse rekenreis"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Jornada diária de matemática"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Jornada diária de matemática"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ежедневное математическое путешествие"}}}},
                    "A small challenge, using the games you know. Each correct first answer moves you forward. Mistakes are a chance to learn; they never erase your progress.": {"extractionState":"manual","comment":"Android Minik Math Plus journey.xml: daily_intro (English and Hebrew; other languages authored for iOS)","localizations":{"am":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"በሚያውቋቸው ጨዋታዎች ትንሽ ፈተና። በመጀመሪያ ሙከራ የሚሰጡት እያንዳንዱ ትክክለኛ መልስ ወደፊት ያራምድዎታል። ስህተቶች የመማሪያ እድል ናቸው፤ እድገትዎን ፈጽሞ አያጠፉም።"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"تحدٍّ صغير بالألعاب التي تعرفها. كل إجابة صحيحة من المحاولة الأولى تقدّمك إلى الأمام. الأخطاء فرصة للتعلّم ولا تمحو تقدّمك أبدًا."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Eine kleine Herausforderung mit Spielen, die du kennst. Jede richtige erste Antwort bringt dich weiter. Fehler sind eine Chance zum Lernen; sie löschen deinen Fortschritt nie."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A small challenge, using the games you know. Each correct first answer moves you forward. Mistakes are a chance to learn; they never erase your progress."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Un pequeño reto con los juegos que ya conoces. Cada respuesta correcta al primer intento te hace avanzar. Los errores son una oportunidad para aprender; nunca borran tu progreso."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Un petit défi avec les jeux que tu connais. Chaque bonne réponse du premier coup te fait avancer. Les erreurs sont une occasion d’apprendre ; elles n’effacent jamais ta progression."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"אתגר קטן במשחקים שאתם מכירים. כל תשובה ראשונה נכונה מקדמת אתכם. טעויות הן הזדמנות ללמוד ואינן מוחקות את ההתקדמות."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Een kleine uitdaging met de spelletjes die je al kent. Elk goed eerste antwoord brengt je verder. Fouten zijn een kans om te leren; ze wissen je voortgang nooit."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Um pequeno desafio com os jogos que você já conhece. Cada resposta certa na primeira tentativa faz você avançar. Os erros são uma chance de aprender; eles nunca apagam o seu progresso."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Um pequeno desafio com os jogos que já conheces. Cada resposta certa à primeira tentativa faz-te avançar. Os erros são uma oportunidade para aprender; nunca apagam o teu progresso."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Небольшое испытание в знакомых играх. Каждый верный ответ с первой попытки продвигает тебя вперёд. Ошибки — это возможность научиться, они никогда не стирают твой прогресс."}}}},
                    "Correct answers: %lld of %lld": {"extractionState":"manual","comment":"Android Minik Math Plus journey.xml: daily_progress (English and Hebrew; other languages authored for iOS)","localizations":{"am":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ትክክለኛ መልሶች፦ ከ%2$lld %1$lld"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"الإجابات الصحيحة: %1$lld من %2$lld"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Richtige Antworten: %1$lld von %2$lld"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Correct answers: %lld of %lld"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Respuestas correctas: %1$lld de %2$lld"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Bonnes réponses : %1$lld sur %2$lld"}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"תשובות נכונות: %1$lld מתוך %2$lld"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Goede antwoorden: %1$lld van %2$lld"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Respostas certas: %1$lld de %2$lld"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Respostas certas: %1$lld de %2$lld"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Правильные ответы: %1$lld из %2$lld"}}}},
                    "The challenge follows your chosen learning level. Your first completed stage each day earns a bonus. You can keep playing, and taking a day off is fine.": {"extractionState":"manual","comment":"Android Minik Math Plus journey.xml: daily_level (English and Hebrew; other languages authored for iOS)","localizations":{"am":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ፈተናው የመረጡትን የትምህርት ደረጃ ይከተላል። በየቀኑ የሚያጠናቅቁት የመጀመሪያው ደረጃ ጉርሻ ያስገኛል። መጫወትዎን መቀጠል ይችላሉ፤ አንድ ቀን ማረፍም ችግር የለውም።"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"يتبع التحدي مستوى التعلّم الذي اخترته. أول مرحلة تكملها كل يوم تمنحك مكافأة. يمكنك مواصلة اللعب، ولا بأس بأخذ يوم راحة."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Die Herausforderung passt zu deiner gewählten Lernstufe. Die erste Etappe, die du an einem Tag schaffst, bringt einen Bonus. Du kannst weiterspielen, und ein freier Tag ist in Ordnung."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The challenge follows your chosen learning level. Your first completed stage each day earns a bonus. You can keep playing, and taking a day off is fine."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"El reto sigue el nivel de aprendizaje que elegiste. La primera etapa que completes cada día te da un premio extra. Puedes seguir jugando, y tomarte un día libre está bien."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le défi suit le niveau d’apprentissage choisi. La première étape réussie chaque jour rapporte un bonus. Tu peux continuer à jouer, et une journée de pause, c’est très bien aussi."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"האתגר מתאים לרמת הלימוד שלכם. השלב הראשון שתשלימו בכל יום מזכה בבונוס. אפשר להמשיך לשחק וגם לנוח יום."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"De uitdaging volgt het leerniveau dat je hebt gekozen. De eerste etappe die je elke dag voltooit, levert een bonus op. Je kunt blijven spelen, en een dagje vrij is ook goed."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O desafio segue o nível de aprendizado que você escolheu. A primeira etapa que você concluir em cada dia vale um bônus. Você pode continuar jogando, e tirar um dia de folga também está tudo bem."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O desafio segue o nível de aprendizagem que escolheste. A primeira etapa que concluíres em cada dia vale um bónus. Podes continuar a jogar, e tirar um dia de folga também não faz mal."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Задание подстраивается под выбранный уровень обучения. Первый пройденный за день этап приносит бонус. Можно продолжать играть, а день отдыха — это нормально."}}}},
                    "Practice stars: %lld": {"extractionState":"manual","comment":"Android Minik Math Plus journey.xml: daily_stars (English and Hebrew; other languages authored for iOS)","localizations":{"am":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"የልምምድ ኮከቦች፦ %lld"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"نجوم التدريب: %lld"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Übungssterne: %lld"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Practice stars: %lld"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Estrellas de práctica: %lld"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Étoiles d’entraînement : %lld"}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"כוכבי אימון: %lld"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Oefensterren: %lld"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Estrelas de prática: %lld"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Estrelas de treino: %lld"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Звёзды за тренировку: %lld"}}}},
                    "A skill worth celebrating!": {"extractionState":"manual","comment":"Android Minik Math Plus journey.xml: daily_done (English and Hebrew; other languages authored for iOS)","localizations":{"am":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"ሊከበር የሚገባ ክህሎት!"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"مهارة تستحق الاحتفال!"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Eine Fähigkeit zum Feiern!"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A skill worth celebrating!"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"¡Una habilidad para celebrar!"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Une compétence à fêter !"}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"כל הכבוד על האימון!"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Een vaardigheid om te vieren!"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Uma habilidade para comemorar!"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Uma competência para celebrar!"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Этот навык стоит отпраздновать!"}}}},
                    "Your progress is saved. Come back for another small step, or try the next skill now.": {"extractionState":"manual","comment":"Android Minik Math Plus journey.xml: daily_done_body (English and Hebrew; other languages authored for iOS)","localizations":{"am":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"እድገትዎ ተቀምጧል። ለሌላ ትንሽ እርምጃ ይመለሱ፣ ወይም ቀጣዩን ክህሎት አሁን ይሞክሩ።"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"تم حفظ تقدّمك. عُد لخطوة صغيرة أخرى، أو جرّب المهارة التالية الآن."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Dein Fortschritt ist gespeichert. Komm für einen weiteren kleinen Schritt zurück oder probiere jetzt die nächste Fähigkeit."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Your progress is saved. Come back for another small step, or try the next skill now."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Tu progreso está guardado. Vuelve para dar otro pequeño paso o prueba ahora la siguiente habilidad."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Ta progression est enregistrée. Reviens pour un autre petit pas, ou essaie dès maintenant la compétence suivante."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ההתקדמות נשמרה. אפשר לחזור לצעד קטן נוסף או לנסות עכשיו את המיומנות הבאה."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Je voortgang is bewaard. Kom terug voor nog een kleine stap, of probeer nu de volgende vaardigheid."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Seu progresso foi salvo. Volte para mais um pequeno passo ou experimente agora a próxima habilidade."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O teu progresso foi guardado. Volta para mais um pequeno passo ou experimenta já a próxima competência."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Твой прогресс сохранён. Возвращайся за новым маленьким шагом или попробуй следующий навык прямо сейчас."}}}},
