                    "Learn this level's facts step by step, then review them in a table.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"am":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"የዚህን ደረጃ ስሌቶች አንድ በአንድ ይማሩ፣ ከዚያም በሰንጠረዥ ይከልሷቸው።"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"تعلّم حقائق هذا المستوى خطوة بخطوة، ثم راجعها في جدول."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Lerne alles von dieser Stufe Schritt für Schritt und wiederhole es dann in einer Tabelle."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Learn this level's facts step by step, then review them in a table."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aprende los datos de este nivel paso a paso y luego repásalos en una tabla."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Apprends les faits de ce niveau pas à pas, puis révise-les dans un tableau."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"למדו את העובדות של הרמה צעד אחר צעד, ואז חזרו עליהן בטבלה."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Leer de rekenfeiten van dit niveau stap voor stap en herhaal ze daarna in een tabel."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aprenda os fatos deste nível passo a passo e depois revise tudo em uma tabela."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Aprende os factos deste nível passo a passo e depois revê-os numa tabela."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Изучай примеры этого уровня шаг за шагом, а потом повторяй их по таблице."}}}},
                    "Online play is not available right now. Check the internet connection and try again.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"am":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"የመስመር ላይ ጨዋታ አሁን አይገኝም። የኢንተርኔት ግንኙነቱን ያረጋግጡ እና እንደገና ይሞክሩ።"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"اللعب عبر الإنترنت غير متاح الآن. تحقق من الاتصال بالإنترنت وحاول مرة أخرى."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Online spielen ist gerade nicht möglich. Prüfe die Internetverbindung und versuche es noch einmal."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Online play is not available right now. Check the internet connection and try again."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"El juego en línea no está disponible en este momento. Revisa la conexión a internet e inténtalo de nuevo."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le jeu en ligne n’est pas disponible pour le moment. Vérifie ta connexion Internet et réessaie."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"המשחק המקוון אינו זמין כרגע. בדקו את החיבור לאינטרנט ונסו שוב."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Online spelen is nu niet beschikbaar. Controleer de internetverbinding en probeer het opnieuw."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O jogo online não está disponível agora. Verifique a conexão com a internet e tente novamente."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O jogo online não está disponível neste momento. Verifica a ligação à internet e tenta novamente."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Онлайн-игра сейчас недоступна. Проверь подключение к интернету и попробуй ещё раз."}}}},
                    "Online play isn't available right now. You can still play with the house players.": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"am":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"የመስመር ላይ ጨዋታ አሁን አይገኝም። አሁንም ከመተግበሪያው የራሱ ተጫዋቾች ጋር መጫወት ይችላሉ።"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"اللعب عبر الإنترنت غير متاح الآن. لا يزال بإمكانك اللعب مع لاعبي التطبيق."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Online spielen ist gerade nicht möglich. Du kannst aber mit den Computerspielern spielen."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Online play isn't available right now. You can still play with the house players."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"El juego en línea no está disponible en este momento. Aun así, puedes jugar con los jugadores de la casa."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Le jeu en ligne n’est pas disponible pour le moment. Tu peux quand même jouer avec les joueurs virtuels."}},"he":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"המשחק המקוון אינו זמין כרגע. עדיין אפשר לשחק עם שחקני הבית."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Online spelen is nu niet beschikbaar. Je kunt wel met de computerspelers spelen."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O jogo online não está disponível agora, mas você pode jogar com os personagens do jogo."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"O jogo online não está disponível neste momento, mas podes jogar com as personagens do jogo."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Онлайн-игра сейчас недоступна. Но можно сыграть с компьютерными игроками."}}}},
